{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2021-04-29 06:30:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER REPORTS STRONG START TO 2021', 'text': "BURLINGTON, MASS. AND FRISCO, TEXAS, APRIL 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. (NASDAQ: KDP) TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2021 AND INCREASED ITS OUTLOOK FOR 2021 NET SALES GROWTH TO 4% TO 6%, FROM THE COMPANY'S PRIOR NET SALES GUIDANCE OF 3% TO 4%."}